# Cloudflare applies these headers to every route. Mirrors the NCS portfolio pattern.
# Content-Security-Policy is intentionally not set — getting it right requires
# testing because of the Sanity CDN, Web3Forms POST, Calendly iframe, and the
# Cloudflare Analytics beacon. Revisit post-launch.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
